      "id": "claim_b2ca71c866df4a74bd648abe88f56fa6",
      "statement": "env.devMock is true when EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_MOCK=1 or Platform.OS === 'web', so the web target is always in dev mock mode (no wallet adapter, no RPC), while native builds opt in explicitly via the env var; src/config/env.ts is the only place it is computed and all consumers read it from there.",
