      "id": "claim_834f3169cb4d4a3fa12f205649a72919",
      "statement": "Because devMock mode can construct and call usePositionsPage without the pipeline ever fetching, the PositionPipeline resolves its Solana Connection lazily: getSharedConnection() builds the shared Connection on first chain access and only then throws a guidance error when EXPO_PUBLIC_RPC_URL is unset — never at import or construction time. This laziness is what lets the RPC-less web bundle boot the full module graph.",
