      "id": "claim_b04c6a41842d426f9b7e77eb8433748c",
      "statement": "getMockOhlcv(pairAddress, timeframe) generates deterministic display-only candles: seeded by FNV-1a hash of pairAddress:timeframe driving a mulberry32 PRNG, anchored at the fixed timestamp 1_700_000_000 for byte-stable reloads, walking within ±8.5% of the pool's base price from MOCK_POOL_BASE_PRICES (the same anchor as the mock liquidity bin range), cached per pairAddress:timeframe in a module Map, and returning null for pair addresses the mock portfolio doesn't know.",
