      "id": "claim_6442ffbabe9942ee8786cc72062f7424",
      "statement": "polyfill.js must be imported before expo-router/entry in index.js and its internal order is fixed: react-native-get-random-values first, then react-native-quick-crypto import, then react-native-url-polyfill/auto, then @craftzdog/react-native-buffer assigned to global.Buffer, then the prototype patches, with quick-crypto's install() running last — so every SDK module Metro evaluates later sees the patched globals.",
